    "description": "The offset and replacement length are bytes. Missing length uses the replacement byte count, zero inserts, and empty replacement deletes.\n\nThe offset and replacement length are bytes. Missing length uses the replacement byte count, zero inserts, and empty replacement deletes.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: frog.studio.string.raw-bytes@1.\nExpected:\nresult (string) = \"abXYcdef\"\nreplaced (string) = \"\"\n",
